(d)regulation 15(2) of those Regulations — one year starting on the date the self‑employed person informs the Board of the amount of that person’s income for the purposes of regulation 15(2) of those Regulations;
(e)regulation 15(3) of those Regulations — one year starting on the date of issue of the notice under regulation 15(3)(a)(ii) of those Regulations relating to the recomputation.
